examples.explanation:
TimeLedger ledger = new TimeLedger();
ledger.set("apple", "red", 1);
ledger.get("apple", 1); // returns "red"
ledger.get("apple", 3); // returns "red", since timestamp 3 <= 3, closest <= 3 is 1 with value "red"
ledger.set("apple", "green", 4);
ledger.get("apple", 4); // returns "green"
